## Install

<SplitLayout>
<SplitSection>
<SplitSectionText>

Add the Sentry Flutter SDK to your `pubspec.yaml`:

</SplitSectionText>
<SplitSectionCode>

```yml {filename:pubspec.yaml}
dependencies:
