## Install

<SplitLayout>

<SplitSection>
<SplitSectionText>

### Install the Sentry SDK

Run the command for your preferred package manager to add the Sentry SDK to your application.

</SplitSectionText>
<SplitSectionCode>

```bash {tabTitle:npm}
npm install @sentry/nextjs --save
